{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"chatcmpl-202610281117461277211898268d9d6u2NHNBWN","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"gemini-3.5-flash","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_f8dcbc5b75de439c99233000480a896e","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"// Yes, Workspace is empty. Perfect!\n// Let's list the required 11 screens to be built:\n// 1. 01_Splash\n// 2. 02_Welcome\n// 3. 03_Create_Account_Empty\n// 4. 03_Create_Account_Filled\n// 5. 03_Create_Account_Error\n// 6. 04_Home\n// 7. 05_My_Asset_Overlay\n// 8. 06_Notification\n// 9. 07_Profile\n// 10. 08_Contact_Info\n// 11. 09_Bank_Account_Info\n//\n// Wait, the brief specifies that:\n// \"05_My_Asset_Overlay\" is an overlay that opens over \"04_Home\". \"05_My_Asset_Overlay opens as an overlay above Home (not a separate pushed screen). Home stays behind it.\"\n// Wait, is it a separate frame in the workspace? Yes, \"Deliver all 11 frames with the exact names above\". So \"05_My_Asset_Overlay\" must be its own frame of size 414 x 932, representing the overlay itself. Let's make sure it contains the underlying home screen, with a semi-transparent dark background layer, and the overlay card on top. This matches \"opens over Home; Home stays behind it\".\n// Let's detail what each frame must include, their contents, data, and layout.\n// Let's design these frames!\n//\n// First, let's load all needed fonts. In Figma, we can load fonts using `await figma.loadFontAsync({ family: \"Inter\", style: \"Regular\" })`, etc.\n// Let's check what styles/fonts we need. We'll load:\n// - family: \"Inter\", style: \"Regular\"\n// - family: \"Inter\", style: \"Medium\"\n// - family: \"Inter\", style: \"Semi Bold\"\n// - family: \"Inter\", style: \"Bold\"\n// - family: \"DM Sans\", style: \"Regular\"\n// - family: \"DM Sans\", style: \"Medium\"\n// - family: \"DM Sans\", style: \"Bold\"\n// Let's run a test font loading script to see if these are available and work.\nasync function testFonts() {\n  await Promise.all([\n    figma.loadFontAsync({ family: \"Inter\", style: \"Regular\" }),\n    figma.loadFontAsync({ family: \"Inter\", style: \"Medium\" }),\n    figma.loadFontAsync({ family: \"Inter\", style: \"Semi Bold\" }),\n    figma.loadFontAsync({ family: \"Inter\", style: \"Bold\" }),\n    figma.loadFontAsync({ family: \"DM Sans\", style: \"Regular\" }),\n    figma.loadFontAsync({ family: \"DM Sans\", style: \"Medium\" }),\n    figma.loadFontAsync({ family: \"DM Sans\", style: \"Bold\" })\n  ]);\n  return \"Fonts loaded successfully!\";\n}\ntestFonts().then(msg => {\n  // throw error to output\n  throw new Error(msg);\n});\n","description":"Test if DM Sans and Inter fonts can be loaded using the Figma API.","fileKey":"1Dyjg6o91wFpVkfahevN0Q"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":45920,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"885502f9-7195-4d21-a73d-fafd5215030c","uuid":"7f85893b-47d2-4e28-8407-0c1f00d206f5","timestamp":"2026-10-28T11:17:53.761Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"call_f8dcbc5b75de439c99233000480a896e","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
