Create_Account_Filled\",\n    \"type\": \"FRAME\",\n    \"x\": 1500,\n    \"y\": 0,\n    \"width\": 414,\n    \"height\": 932\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"2042:114\",\n    \"name\": \"03_Create_Account_Error\",\n    \"type\": \"FRAME\",\n    \"x\": 2000,\n    \"y\": 0,\n    \"width\": 414,\n    \"height\": 932\n  }\n]\n    at <anonymous> (PLUGIN_1_SOURCE:6:18)\n    at <eval> (PLUGIN_1_SOURCE:10:3)\n\nFigma Debug UUID: 63c1060f-c307-45cf-8105-ab104569b0a7","_meta":{"mcpRequestId":"63c1060f-c307-45cf-8105-ab104569b0a7"}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"call_ece760538e94465fbce52617d5b6c6a0","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"chatcmpl-202610281143165621403458268d9d67U0br60b","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"gemini-3.5-flash","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_96a40b46a41b4608b0006af91951c0c3","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"// Absolutely perfect! All first 5 screens are created with exact specifications, positions, names, and visual flair.\n// Now, let's design the next set of screens!\n//\n// 6. 04_Home\n//    - Position: x = 0, y = 1100 (Row 2, column 1)\n//    - Background: Light grey #F6F6F6. This is perfect for a dashboard-style surface!\n//    - Must include:\n//      - Account: \"Welcome, Jonas.\" · menu entry · notification entry\n//      - Actions: Invest now (Button, e.g., \"Invest now\" or \"Invest\" with positive energy)\n//      - Articles: \"Investment Guide\" · 3 articles, each with title, summary and thumbnail:\n//        - Title 1: \"Basic type of investments\" · Summary 1: \"This is how you set your foot for the 2020 stock market recession. What’s next…\"\n//        - Title 2: \"How much can you start with?\" · Summary 2: \"What do you like to see? It’s a very different market from 2018. The way…\"\n//        - Title 3: \"Welcome to New NASDAQ\" · Summary 3: \"When we talk about Wall Street, what looks good might be different…\" (no photo supplied: choose a consistent fallback, e.g., a colored placeholder card with icon or generic graphic)\n//      - Main navigation: current tab Home (Home tab highlighted, others dimmed/inactive in bottom navigation).\n//        - Bottom navigation order: Home (current) -> 04 · Product (entry only) · Transaction (entry only) · Account -> 07.\n//      - Plans: \"Best Plans\" · See All · Gold 30% / Silver 60% / Platinum 90% return, each with its coin image.\n//        - Gold return: 30% return\n//        - Silver return: 60% return\n//        - Platinum return: 90% return\n//        - Coins: Let's draw stylized gold, silver, and platinum coins using vector shapes.\n//      - Portfolio: \"Your total asset portfolio\" · ₦203,935 · +2%\n//        - Let's design a gorgeous credit-card style or deep-green rounded gradient background card for this portfolio section! Size e.g., 358 x 140. With ₦203,935 in white/bold, \"+2%\" in soft light green with an upvote/upward arrow next to it.\n//\n// Let's think about the Bottom Navigation Bar design:\n// - Height: 80\n// - Position: x = 0, y = 932 - 80 = 852 (inside standard viewport). Wait, status bar at the top, home indicator at the bottom (overlapping or inside bottom nav). Actually, let's make a bottom navigation container that spans 414 x 80.\n// - Inside it, 4 tabs:\n//   - Tab 1: Home. Active color is primary brand green #31A062. Cloned from \"5:91\" (Icon_Tab_Home). Label \"Home\", active.\n//   - Tab 2: Product. Inactive color #828282. Cloned from \"5:95\" (Icon_Tab_Product_Search). Label \"Product\".\n//   - Tab 3: Transaction. Inactive. Cloned from \"5:99\" (Icon_Tab_Transaction). Label \"Transaction\".\n//   - Tab 4: Account. Inactive. Cloned from \"5:103\" (Icon_Tab_Account). Label \"Account\".\n// - Let's make sure the current tab is styled differently (e.g. active color, small dot or line underneath).\n//\n// Let's think about the Header Bar for Home:\n// - Cloned Icon_Menu (\"5:107\") on the left (x = 24, y = 60).\n// - Cloned Icon_Notification (\"5:111\") on the right (x = 350, y = 60).\n// - Let's make sure that clicking on the notification icon links to \"06_Notification\".\n//\n// Let's write a script that builds 04_Home, 05_My_Asset_Overlay, and 06_Notification!\n//\n// 7. 05_My_Asset_Overlay\n//    - Goal: inspect holdings and recent activity without leaving Home.\n//    - Position: x = 500, y = 1100\n//    - \"opens over Home; Home stays behind it\".\n//    - We will duplicate the entire 04_Home frame first inside 05_My_Asset_Overlay!\n//    - Then, we'll append a semi-transparent black overlay rectangle (color: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0}, opacity: 0.5) covering the entire screen (414 x 932).\n//    - On top of this, we'll draw a beautiful bottom sheet card!\n//      - Background: White (#FFFFFF)\n//      - Corner radius: 30 for top corners (topLeft, topRight)\n//      - Position: x = 0, y = 250, width = 414, height = 682 (sliding up from the bottom).\n//      - Top handlebar/indicator inside card (small grey rounded rectangle, x = 187, y = 10, width = 40, height = 5).\n//      - Inside card, must include:\n//        - \"My Asset\" (Title, size 24, bold, DM Sans, x = 30, y = 40)\n//        - Close button: Cloned Icon_Close (\"5:123\") in top right. Let's place it at x = 344, y = 36.\n//        - \"Your total asset portfolio\" (copied or same layout as Home card, size 16/32, showing ₦203,935 and +2%).\n//        - \"Current Plans\" section: Gold, 30% return. Card with its coin image.\n//        - \"See All Plans\" link/button (text or button).\n//        - \"History\" section: \"History\" title, and 4 transaction items, all dated Mon 22 Jun 2020:\n//          1. Buy \"AAPL\" Stock, amount ₦200,000, date Mon 22 Jun 2020. (Buy = money out, red text or neutral)\n//          2. Sell \"TLKM\" Stock, amount ₦150,000, date Mon 22 Jun 2020. (Sell = money in, green text)\n//          3. Buy \"FB\" Stock, amount ₦1,000,240, date Mon 22 Jun 2020.\n//          4. Sell \"AAPL\" Stock, amount ₦1,000,240, date Mon 22 Jun 2020.\n//\n// 8. 06_Notification\n//    - Goal: scan recent updates quickly.\n//    - Position: x = 1000, y = 1100\n//    - Background: White (#FFFFFF) or light grey.\n//    - Top bar: Standard status bar. Back button (cloned Icon_Back \"5:115\") at x = 24, y = 60.\n//    - Title: \"Notification\" (bold, size 24, DM Sans, x = 74, y = 66, next to back button).\n//    - Notifications list: 3 items, newest first, each with thumbnail, message and time.\n//      - Item 1: Thumbnail (rounded box with a bell/alert icon or small graphic), message \"Apple stocks just increased. Check it out now.\", time \"15 min ago\".\n//      - Item 2: Thumbnail, message \"Check out today’s best investor. You’ll learn from him.\", time \"3 min ago\". Wait! The brief says: \"Notifications (newest first): 'Where do you see yourself in the next ages?' 30 secs ago · 'Check out today’s best investor. You’ll learn from him.' 3 min ago · 'Apple stocks just increased. Check it out now.' 15 min ago.\"\n//        - Ah! \"newest first\":\n//          1. \"Where do you see yourself in the next ages?\" 30 secs ago\n//          2. \"Check out today’s best investor. You’ll learn from him.\" 3 min ago\n//          3. \"Apple stocks just increased. Check it out now.\" 15 min ago\n//        Let's lay these out beautifully as a list of list-items, separated by thin dividers.\n//\n// Let's write the code to generate Home, My Asset Overlay, and Notification screens! Let's build them with gorgeous fidelity.\nconst code = `\nasync function buildSecondScreens() {\n  const workspacePage = figma.root.children.find(p => p.id === \"2003:2\");\n  if (!workspacePage) throw new Error(\"Workspace page not found\");\n  await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(workspacePage);\n\n  // Load fonts\n  await Promise.all([\n    figma.loadFontAsync({ family: \"Inter\", style: \"Regular\" }),\n    figma.loadFontAsync({ family: \"Inter\", style: \"Medium\" }),\n    figma.loadFontAsync({ family: \"Inter\", style: \"Semi Bold\" }),\n    figma.loadFontAsync({ family: \"Inter\", style: \"Bold\" }),\n    figma.loadFontAsync({ family: \"DM Sans\", style: \"Regular\" }),\n    figma.loadFontAsync({ family: \"DM Sans\", style: \"Medium\" }),\n    figma.loadFontAsync({ family: \"DM Sans\", style: \"Bold\" })\n  ]);\n\n  const primaryColor = { r: 49/255, g: 160/255, b: 98/255 }; // #31A062\n  const textDarkColor = { r: 26/255, g: 26/255, b: 26/255 }; // #1A1A1A\n  const textGreyColor = { r: 130/255, g: 130/255, b: 130/255 }; // #828282\n  const textLightColor = { r: 189/255, g: 189/255, b: 189/255 }; // #BDBDBD\n  const dividerColor = { r: 240/255, g: 240/255, b: 240/255 }; // #F0F0F0\n  const bgGreyColor = { r: 246/255, g: 246/255, b: 246/255 }; // #F6F6F6\n  const bgCardColor = { r: 255/255, g: 255/255, b: 255/255 };\n\n  const statusBarComp = figma.getNodeById(\"48:43\");\n  const homeIndicatorComp = figma.getNodeById(\"48:54\");\n\n  // Load Icons from Page 1:4\n  const iconHome = figma.getNodeById(\"5:91\");\n  const iconProduct = figma.getNodeById(\"5:95\");\n  const iconTransaction = figma.getNodeById(\"5:99\");\n  const iconAccount = figma.getNodeById(\"5:103\");\n  const iconMenu = figma.getNodeById(\"5:107\");\n  const iconNotification = figma.getNodeById(\"5:111\");\n  const iconBack = figma.getNodeById(\"5:115\");\n  const iconChevron = figma.getNodeById(\"5:119\");\n  const iconClose = figma.getNodeById(\"5:123\");\n\n  function addShell(frame) {\n    if (statusBarComp) {\n      const sb = statusBarComp.clone();\n      sb.x = 0;\n      sb.y = 0;\n      frame.appendChild(sb);\n    }\n    if (homeIndicatorComp) {\n      const hi = homeIndicatorComp.clone();\n      hi.x = 0;\n      hi.y = 932 - hi.height;\n      frame.appendChild(hi);\n    }\n  }\n\n  // Bottom Tab Navigation Bar Helper\n  function addBottomNav(frame, activeTab) {\n    const navBar = figma.createFrame();\n    navBar.name = \"Bottom_Nav_Bar\";\n    navBar.resize(414, 84);\n    navBar.x = 0;\n    navBar.y = 848 - 14; // Position just above home indicator\n    navBar.fills = [{ type: \"SOLID\", color: { r: 1, g: 1, b: 1 } }];\n    navBar.effects = [{\n      type: \"DROP_SHADOW\",\n      color: { r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 0.05 },\n      offset: { x: 0, y: -4 },\n      radius: 10,\n      visible: true,\n      blendMode: \"NORMAL\"\n    }];\n    frame.appendChild(navBar);\n\n    const tabs = [\n      { name: \"Home\", icon: iconHome, label: \"Home\" },\n      { name: \"Product\", icon: iconProduct, label: \"Product\" },\n      { name: \"Transaction\", icon: iconTransaction, label: \"Transaction\" },\n      { name: \"Account\", icon: iconAccount, label: \"Profile\" }\n    ];\n\n    tabs.forEach((tab, index) => {\n      const tabGroup = figma.createFrame();\n      tabGroup.name = \"Tab_\" + tab.name;\n      tabGroup.resize(90, 70);\n      tabGroup.x = 24 + index * 90;\n      tabGroup.y = 0;\n      tabGroup.fills = [];\n      navBar.appendChild(tabGroup);\n\n      const isActive = tab.name === activeTab;\n      const color = isActive ? primaryColor : textGreyColor;\n\n      // Add icon clone if available\n      if (tab.icon) {\n        const iconClone = tab.icon.clone();\n        iconClone.x = 33;\n        iconClone.y = 12;\n        // recolor paths in clone to primary or grey\n        recolorNode(iconClone, color);\n        tabGroup.appendChild(iconClone);\n      }\n\n      // Add label text\n      const lbl = figma.createText();\n      lbl.fontName = { family: \"Inter\", style: \"Medium\" };\n      lbl.fontSize = 11;\n      lbl.characters = tab.label;\n      lbl.fills = [{ type: \"SOLID\", color: color }];\n      lbl.textAlignHorizontal = \"CENTER\";\n      lbl.resize(90, 16);\n      lbl.x = 0;\n      lbl.y = 42;\n      tabGroup.appendChild(lbl);\n    });\n  }\n\n  // Recolor helper for cloned vectors\n  function recolorNode(node, color) {\n    if (node.type === \"VECTOR\" || node.type === \"BOOLEAN_OPERATION\") {\n      node.fills = [{ type: \"SOLID\", color: color }];\n    }\n    if (\"children\" in node) {\n      for (const child of node.children) {\n        recolorNode(child, color);\n      }\n    }\n  }\n\n  // Helper to draw a coin\n  function drawCoin(parent, x, y, name, textSymbol, faceColor, textColor) {\n    const coinFrame = figma.createFrame();\n    coinFrame.name = name + \"_Coin\";\n    coinFrame.resize(48, 48);\n    coinFrame.x = x;\n    coinFrame.y = y;\n    coinFrame.cornerRadius = 24;\n    coinFrame.fills = [{ type: \"SOLID\", color: faceColor }];\n    parent.appendChild(coinFrame);\n\n    const coinInner = figma.createEllipse();\n    coinInner.resize(38, 38);\n    coinInner.x = 5;\n    coinInner.y = 5;\n    coinInner.fills = [];\n    coinInner.strokes = [{ type: \"SOLID\", color: textColor }];\n    coinInner.strokeWeight = 1.5;\n    coinFrame.appendChild(coinInner);\n\n    const coinTxt = figma.createText();\n    coinTxt.fontName = { family: \"DM Sans\", style: \"Bold\" };\n    coinTxt.fontSize = 18;\n    coinTxt.characters = textSymbol;\n    coinTxt.fills = [{ type: \"SOLID\", color: textColor }];\n    coinTxt.textAlignHorizontal = \"CENTER\";\n    coinTxt.textAlignVertical = \"CENTER\";\n    coinTxt.resize(48, 48);\n    coinTxt.x = 0;\n    coinTxt.y = 0;\n    coinFrame.appendChild(coinTxt);\n  }\n\n\n  // ----------------------------------------------------\n  // 04_Home\n  // ----------------------------------------------------\n  const home = figma.createFrame();\n  home.name = \"04_Home\";\n  home.resize(414, 932);\n  home.x = 0;\n  home.y = 1100;\n  home.fills = [{ type: \"SOLID\", color: bgGreyColor }];\n  workspacePage.appendChild(home);\n  addShell(home);\n\n  // Home Header (Menu and Notification)\n  const homeHeader = figma.createFrame();\n  homeHeader.name = \"Header_Bar\";\n  homeHeader.resize(414, 60);\n  homeHeader.x = 0;\n  homeHeader.y = 54;\n  homeHeader.fills = [];\n  home.appendChild(homeHeader);\n\n  if (iconMenu) {\n    const menuClone = iconMenu.clone();\n    menuClone.x = 24;\n    menuClone.y = 18;\n    recolorNode(menuClone, textDarkColor);\n    homeHeader.appendChild(menuClone);\n  }\n\n  if (iconNotification) {\n    const notClone = iconNotification.clone();\n    notClone.x = 358;\n    notClone.y = 18;\n    recolorNode(notClone, textDarkColor);\n    homeHeader.appendChild(notClone);\n  }\n\n  // Greeting\n  const greetText = figma.createText();\n  greetText.fontName = { family: \"DM Sans\", style: \"Bold\" };\n  greetText.fontSize = 32;\n  greetText.characters = \"Welcome, Jonas.\";\n  greetText.fills = [{ type: \"SOLID\", color: textDarkColor }];\n  greetText.x = 24;\n  greetText.y = 120;\n  home.appendChild(greetText);\n\n  // Portfolio Card\n  const portCard = figma.createFrame();\n  portCard.name = \"Portfolio_Card\";\n  portCard.resize(366, 145);\n  portCard.x = 24;\n  portCard.y = 176;\n  portCard.cornerRadius = 20;\n  portCard.fills = [{\n    type: \"GRADIENT_LINEAR\",\n    gradientTransform: [[1, 0, 0], [0, 1, 0]],\n    gradientStops: [\n      { position: 0, color: { r: 49/255, g: 160/255, b: 98/255, a: 1 } },\n      { position: 1, color: { r: 34/255, g: 112/255, b: 69/255, a: 1 } }\n    ]\n  }];\n  home.appendChild(portCard);\n\n  const portLbl = figma.createText();\n  portLbl.fontName = { family: \"Inter\", style: \"Medium\" };\n  portLbl.fontSize = 14;\n  portLbl.characters = \"Your total asset portfolio\";\n  portLbl.fills = [{ type: \"SOLID\", color: { r: 220/255, g: 245/255, b: 230/255 } }];\n  portLbl.x = 24;\n  portLbl.y = 24;\n  portCard.appendChild(portLbl);\n\n  const portAmt = figma.createText();\n  portAmt.fontName = { family: \"DM Sans\", style: \"Bold\" };\n  portAmt.fontSize = 32;\n  portAmt.characters = \"₦203,935\";\n  portAmt.fills = [{ type: \"SOLID\", color: { r: 1, g: 1, b: 1 } }];\n  portAmt.x = 24;\n  portAmt.y = 48;\n  portCard.appendChild(portAmt);\n\n  const portChgGroup = figma.createFrame();\n  portChgGroup.name = \"Change_Indicator\";\n  portChgGroup.resize(80, 28);\n  portChgGroup.x = 24;\n  portChgGroup.y = 96;\n  portChgGroup.cornerRadius = 14;\n  portChgGroup.fills = [{ type: \"SOLID\", color: { r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 0.15 } }];\n  portCard.appendChild(portChgGroup);\n\n  const upvoteClone = figma.getNodeById(\"5:135\").clone();\n  upvoteClone.x = 8;\n  upvoteClone.y = 6;\n  recolorNode(upvoteClone, { r: 1, g: 1, b: 1 });\n  portChgGroup.appendChild(upvoteClone);\n\n  const portChgTxt = figma.createText();\n  portChgTxt.fontName = { family: \"Inter\", style: \"Bold\" };\n  portChgTxt.fontSize = 13;\n  portChgTxt.characters = \"+2%\";\n  portChgTxt.fills = [{ type: \"SOLID\", color: { r: 1, g: 1, b: 1 } }];\n  portChgTxt.x = 28;\n  portChgTxt.y = 6;\n  portChgGroup.appendChild(portChgTxt);\n\n  // \"Invest now\" button in the portfolio card\n  const investBtn = figma.createFrame();\n  investBtn.name = \"Button_Invest_Now\";\n  investBtn.resize(110, 42);\n  investBtn.x = 232;\n  investBtn.y = 78;\n  investBtn.cornerRadius = 12;\n  investBtn.fills = [{ type: \"SOLID\", color: { r: 1, g: 1, b: 1 } }];\n  portCard.appendChild(investBtn);\n\n  const investBtnTxt = figma.createText();\n  investBtnTxt.fontName = { family: \"Inter\", style: \"Semi Bold\" };\n  investBtnTxt.fontSize = 14;\n  investBtnTxt.characters = \"Invest now\";\n  investBtnTxt.fills = [{ type: \"SOLID\", color: primaryColor }];\n  investBtnTxt.textAlignHorizontal = \"CENTER\";\n  investBtnTxt.textAlignVertical = \"CENTER\";\n  investBtnTxt.resize(110, 42);\n  investBtnTxt.x = 0;\n  investBtnTxt.y = 0;\n  investBtn.appendChild(investBtnTxt);\n\n  // PLANS SECTION\n  const plansHeader = figma.createFrame();\n  plansHeader.name = \"Plans_Header\";\n  plansHeader.resize(366, 30);\n  plansHeader.x = 24;\n  plansHeader.y = 345;\n  plansHeader.fills = [];\n  home.appendChild(plansHeader);\n\n  const plansTitle = figma.createText();\n  plansTitle.fontName = { family: \"DM Sans\", style: \"Bold\" };\n  plansTitle.fontSize = 20;\n  plansTitle.characters = \"Best Plans\";\n  plansTitle.fills = [{ type: \"SOLID\", color: textDarkColor }];\n  plansTitle.x = 0;\n  plansTitle.y = 0;\n  plansHeader.appendChild(plansTitle);\n\n  const seeAllPlans = figma.createText();\n  seeAllPlans.fontName = { family: \"Inter\", style: \"Semi Bold\" };\n  seeAllPlans.fontSize = 14;\n  seeAllPlans.characters = \"See All\";\n  seeAllPlans.fills = [{ type: \"SOLID\", color: primaryColor }];\n  seeAllPlans.x = 310;\n  seeAllPlans.y = 4;\n  plansHeader.appendChild(seeAllPlans);\n\n  // Horizontal Scrolling Plans (We'll position them 3 plans horizontally)\n  function createPlanCard(x, y, name, returnVal, bgStyle, coinSymbol, coinBg, coinColor) {\n    const card = figma.createFrame();\n    card.name = \"Plan_\" + na